 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He sent us out across the sea and climbed the hill to pray",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The night came down around us and the land was far away",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The wind was hard against us and the waves were breaking high",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We were straining at the oars beneath a black and starless sky",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the fourth watch of the night he came walking on the sea",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a ghost, we cried in terror, there was nowhere we could flee",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But his voice came through the thunder like a light across the deep",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take heart, it is I, do not be afraid",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take heart, it is I",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the wind is high and the water is wide",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Take heart, it is I",
