   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Peter said, Lord, if it's you, then tell me, come to you",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He stepped out on the water and he walked a step or two",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he saw how strong the wind was and he started going down",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
